From 62f89c83dc793ba98af61e7667f39e08042f527d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wendy Labs <engineering@wendy.dev>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 21:31:29 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] update: reject incompatible data encryption before slot write

Upstream-Status: Pending


Plain-data artifacts keep the stock v1 wire format for OTA bootstrap; LUKS2
uses explicit v2 metadata. The existing live-data compatibility guard remains.

